  "solution": {
    "text": "Current through the galvanometer<br /><br /><math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2950</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>A</mtext></math><br /><br />Current for 30 divisions <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>A</mtext></math><br /><br />Current for 20 divisions<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>A</mtext></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0002_5524873db512.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 252px; height: 193px;\" /><br /><br />For the same deflection to obtain for 20 divisions, let resistance added be R<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4450&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>"
